+ * Adreno 640 bring-up console, gates G0 and G1. Lines that start with "g " arrive from cepheus_usb.c (UDP port 5141
+ * of the phone); the answers go to the live log as "CEPHEUS GPU:". The only writes are those of "g g1", through a
